---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | Calyflow';
const description =
  'Plain-language privacy policy: EU-based processing, cookieless analytics, no personal data collected by this website.';
const updated = 'June 10, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-[68ch] px-5 py-16 md:py-20">
    <h1 class="text-3xl tracking-tight md:text-4xl">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[0.8125rem] text-navy-800/70">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="prose-calyflow mt-10">
      <p>
        <strong>The short version:</strong> this website collects no personal data, sets no
        tracking cookies, and shows no consent banner because none is needed. We are an EU-based
        company and GDPR is our home turf, not an afterthought.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Calyflow is an EU-based company. For anything privacy-related, contact us at
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What this website collects</h2>
      <p>
        We use cookieless, privacy-friendly analytics (Cloudflare Web Analytics) to understand
        aggregate traffic: which pages are visited, roughly where visitors come from, and what
        device class they use. This works without cookies, without fingerprinting, and without
        storing anything on your device. We cannot identify you from it, and we do not try to.
      </p>
      <p>We do not collect names, email addresses, IP address logs, or any other personal data on this website.</p>

      <h2>What happens when you sign up for the app</h2>
      <p>
        The Calyflow application at <a href={SITE.appUrl}>app.calyflow.ai</a> has its own account
        system and processes data you bring to it (such as job descriptions and CVs) under your
        instructions. The key design principle: your candidate data stays in your own systems.
        Calyflow connects to them to run workflows but does not warehouse your data. App-specific
        privacy terms are presented at sign-up.
      </p>

      <h2>Where processing happens</h2>
      <p>
        Our infrastructure and processing are EU-based. This website is served from a global CDN
        (Cloudflare) for performance, which acts as our processor for delivering static pages.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under GDPR you have the right to access, rectify, erase, and port your personal data, and
        to object to or restrict its processing. Since this website holds no personal data about
        you, there is usually nothing to act on, but if you believe otherwise, email
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a> and we will respond
        promptly. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with your local supervisory
        authority.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this policy changes, we will update this page and the date at the top. No silent
        rewrites.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
